{"4249510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In a World Full of Zombies I'm the Only One Who Doesn't Get Attacked: Road to Heaven", "steam_appid": 4249510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the popular series &quot;In a World Full of Zombies I'm the Only One Who Doesn't Get Attacked,&quot; this RTS and tower defense hybrid puts you in control of Yusuke Takemura as he and his companions journey toward Heaven, the safe zone announced over the radio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/9339035324204ce0b5646c1a711e4a8c.avif?t=1786962339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras_big/9339035324204ce0b5646c1a711e4a8c.webp?t=1786962339 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, Yusuke's group must repeatedly prepare, defend, and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study the zombies' attack routes, place defensive facilities and traps, and position your allies before each assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and upgrade weapons, then decide who should carry each piece of equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/07962c1245d8ad3eaf1fc274435911ed.poster.avif?t=1786962339\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/07962c1245d8ad3eaf1fc274435911ed.webm?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/07962c1245d8ad3eaf1fc274435911ed.mp4?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During zombie attacks, you directly control Yusuke as he moves across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because zombies will not attack him, Yusuke can act in ways ordinary survivors cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your own weapons. Move into dangerous areas to support your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use traps and defensive facilities to recover from a collapsing battle line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will determine whether the group survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/f65a8c35ad319e4f074040c5dba59d1e.poster.avif?t=1786962339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/f65a8c35ad319e4f074040c5dba59d1e.webm?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/f65a8c35ad319e4f074040c5dba59d1e.mp4?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful defense, you'll have only a limited amount of time to decide whether to spend it with your allies, search for materials, or look for new survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The materials you gather during exploration are essential for upgrading your weapons, traps, and defensive facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/e2d751b467a49bec18da0a57f1b07e3f.poster.avif?t=1786962339\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/e2d751b467a49bec18da0a57f1b07e3f.webm?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/e2d751b467a49bec18da0a57f1b07e3f.mp4?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/5f7d1e247521a917f5d135712a8b97e6.avif?t=1786962339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras_big/5f7d1e247521a917f5d135712a8b97e6.webp?t=1786962339 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this alternate timeline, characters who never met in the original story, former enemies, and even those who had already died may become your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reach out and help others? Will you make ruthless choices to keep your own group alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kind of survivor Yusuke Takemura becomes is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the popular series &quot;In a World Full of Zombies I'm the Only One Who Doesn't Get Attacked,&quot; this RTS and tower defense hybrid puts you in control of Yusuke Takemura as he and his companions journey toward Heaven, the safe zone announced over the radio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/9339035324204ce0b5646c1a711e4a8c.avif?t=1786962339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras_big/9339035324204ce0b5646c1a711e4a8c.webp?t=1786962339 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, Yusuke's group must repeatedly prepare, defend, and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study the zombies' attack routes, place defensive facilities and traps, and position your allies before each assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and upgrade weapons, then decide who should carry each piece of equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/07962c1245d8ad3eaf1fc274435911ed.poster.avif?t=1786962339\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/07962c1245d8ad3eaf1fc274435911ed.webm?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/07962c1245d8ad3eaf1fc274435911ed.mp4?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During zombie attacks, you directly control Yusuke as he moves across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because zombies will not attack him, Yusuke can act in ways ordinary survivors cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your own weapons. Move into dangerous areas to support your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use traps and defensive facilities to recover from a collapsing battle line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will determine whether the group survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/f65a8c35ad319e4f074040c5dba59d1e.poster.avif?t=1786962339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/f65a8c35ad319e4f074040c5dba59d1e.webm?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/f65a8c35ad319e4f074040c5dba59d1e.mp4?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful defense, you'll have only a limited amount of time to decide whether to spend it with your allies, search for materials, or look for new survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The materials you gather during exploration are essential for upgrading your weapons, traps, and defensive facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/e2d751b467a49bec18da0a57f1b07e3f.poster.avif?t=1786962339\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/e2d751b467a49bec18da0a57f1b07e3f.webm?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/e2d751b467a49bec18da0a57f1b07e3f.mp4?t=1786962339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras/5f7d1e247521a917f5d135712a8b97e6.avif?t=1786962339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249510/extras_big/5f7d1e247521a917f5d135712a8b97e6.webp?t=1786962339 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this alternate timeline, characters who never met in the original story, former enemies, and even those who had already died may become your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reach out and help others? Will you make ruthless choices to keep your own group alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kind of survivor Yusuke Takemura becomes is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A man the zombies will not attack fights to protect his allies and base as they journey toward Heaven. Prepare defenses, deploy allies, upgrade equipment, and set traps to survive the horde in this RTS and tower defense hybr